 "description": "<p>A seven-piece maid set in rose-patterned lace: headband, neck ring, uniform, apron, bracelet, thong, and leg ring, one size for 40-60 kg. Seven pieces is the top of the category, and the rose lace ties them together visually.</p>\n<p>The apron and leg rings are the pieces that justify the count - they are what a four-piece set leaves out, and they are what makes the maid read complete. See-through lace throughout, in the colorway shown.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: lace with rose pattern</li>\n<li>Includes: headband, neck ring, uniform, apron, bracelet, thong, leg ring</li>\n<li>Style: maid</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The fullest maid kit on the site, in the softest fabric it comes in.</p>\n",
